# M3 memory-pipe gate: two loads and two stores at once (forwarding, store
# buffer merges of one cycle, order violations on either pipe, pairs of
# retiring stores), pass/fail on both cores.
# Format: <suite>/<name> [budget=<cycles>] [hex=<path>] [tohost=<word index>]
mem/mem2 budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mem2.hex
